{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17671","headline":"郡中言怀寄西川萧员外 · 羊士谔","name":"郡中言怀寄西川萧员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"功名无力愧勤王，已近终南得草堂。\n身外尽归天竺偈，腰间唯有会稽章。\n何时腊酒逢山客，可惜梅枝亚石牀。\n岁晚我知仙客意，悬心应在白云乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17671.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17671","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}